// Chemistry: the elements and the pure substances (see crates/data/src/chemistry.rs).
// Elements: symbol, name, z, mass (g/mol), en (Pauling), melt/boil (K, 1 bar), abund (solar,
// log10 atoms per 1e12 H). Compounds: formula (no parentheses), class, hf (standard enthalpy of
